{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">FULLET EXPLICATIU</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">DE</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">les Taules Auxiliars Delmas</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">PRIMERA SÈRIE</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">TAULA N.º 1</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">L’Escola. — L’Institut. — L’Aula.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Descripció general.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — Aquesta taula representa una <b>aula</b> d’<b>institut</b>. En aquesta aula hi ha vuit <b>taules</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"taules\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> i vuit <b>bancs</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"bancs\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button>. En cada banc s’asseuen tres alumnes. El <b>professor</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"professor\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> està assegut en una <b>cadira</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"cadira\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> a la seva <b>càtedra</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"càtedra\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button>.","t01-02-1":"2. — A l’esquerra de la càtedra hi ha un <b>armari</b> amb portes de vidre <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"física\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button>. A la dreta hi ha la <b>pissarra</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"pissarra\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> amb l’<b>esborrador</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"esborrador\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> i el <b>guix</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"guix\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>.","t01-02-2":"Damunt de la càtedra pengen unes <b>làmines murals</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"làmines murals\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"làmines murals\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"làmines murals\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> i un <b>mapa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"mapa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>.","t01-03-1":"3. — No tots els alumnes són al seu <b>lloc</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"lloc\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>. Joan <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> és dret vora la pissarra; sosté l’esborrador i esborra les <b>figures de geometria</b>.","t01-03-2":"Pere és a prop de la càtedra; recull els <b>exercicis escrits</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"exercicis escrits\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> i els porta al professor.","t01-04-1":"4. — <b>Aquest</b> professor és el professor de <b>llengües modernes</b>. Ensenya els alumnes a parlar, llegir i escriure llengües estrangeres <b>(alemany, anglès, espanyol, italià, rus</b> o <b>francès)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — L’aula és molt àmplia i molt clara. Al fons hi ha una <b>finestra</b> ampla amb dos <b>muntants</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"muntants\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> i una <b>porta envidrada</b> per ventilar-la i il·luminar-la.","t01-05-2":"Aquesta aula no és freda. Al mig, per escalfar-la, hi ha una <b>estufa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"estufa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> molt bona amb el seu <b>tub</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"tub\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>.","t01-05-3":"A l’envà hi ha fixats uns <b>penjadors</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"penjadors\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button>; d’ells pengen les gorres i els abrics dels alumnes.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">El pati d’esbarjo.</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — El <b>rellotge</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"rellotge\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> marca les nou i cinc.","t01-06-2":"L’<b>esbarjo</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"esbarjo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> acaba d’acabar i la classe torna a començar. L’esbarjo es fa al <b>pati</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"pati\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>. Veiem uns quants alumnes que juguen. Un <b>passant</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"passant\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> els vigila.","t01-07-1":"7. — Al pati veiem a més altres persones: l’<b>inspector</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspector\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, el <b>director</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"director\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> i el <b>cap d’estudis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"cap d'estudis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>.","t01-07-2":"L’inspector inspecciona les escoles, el director dirigeix l’institut, el cap d’estudis vigila els estudis.","t01-07-3":"El quart personatge és el <b>conserge</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"conserge\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>. Porta sota el braç un registre per anotar-hi els absents.","t01-08-1":"8. — Al fons del pati hi ha els <b>aparells de gimnàstica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"aparells de gimnàstica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> i el taller de <b>treballs manuals</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"treballs manuals\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>.","t01-08-2":"A la dreta de la taula comencem a veure les <b>aules</b> de <b>música</b> i de <b>dibuix</b>.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Descripció detallada.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Els bons alumnes.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — Els alumnes del primer banc a la dreta de la càtedra són <b>Enric</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"ca-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>Esteve</b> i <b>Carles</b>.","t01-09-2":"Enric és molt atent i treballador; escolta el professor. Sobre la seva taula té un <b>quadern</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"quadern\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, un <b>llibre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"llibre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, un <b>diccionari</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"diccionari\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> i un <b>plomer</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"plomer\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>. El seu llibre té moltes <b>pàgines</b>; cada capítol conté diversos <b>paràgrafs</b> i cada <b>línia</b> moltes <b>paraules</b>.","t01-09-4":"El seu veí Esteve <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> és aplicat. Apunta al seu quadern la lliçó per a la pròxima vegada. Té bona <b>lletra</b>. El seu llibre és tancat. Només veiem la <b>coberta</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"coberta\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>. Al seu costat hi ha el seu <b>compàs</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"compàs\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>.","t01-09-5":"Carles <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> sosté el seu llibre a la mà; l’obre per repassar la lliçó. Com tots els alumnes, té al davant un <b>tinter</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"tinter\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button>. És obedient.","t01-10-1":"10. — A la taula del costat hi ha <b>Lluís, Antoni</b> i <b>Pau</b>. Lluís recita la seva <b>lliçó</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"lliçó\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> i respon a les <b>preguntes</b> del professor. Antoni <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> està molt distret; de vegades el professor fins i tot el castiga. Pau <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> és bon company, amable i servicial. És molt atent.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Els mals alumnes.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — Darrere d’Enric hi ha <b>Jordi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Jordi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>. No és mal noi, però és <b>xerraire</b>, distret i inquiet. La seva <b>lleugeresa</b> i la seva <b>desobediència</b> causen <b>desordre</b> durant la classe, i sovint mereix una severa <b>advertència</b>. El seu <b>quadern d’esborrany</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"quadern d'esborrany\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> és brut, l’omple de <b>taques de tinta</b> amb la seva <b>ploma</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"ploma\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>, i per això sempre fa servir la seva <b>goma d’esborrar</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"goma d'esborrar\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>; la seva <b>cartera</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"cartera\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> és trencada, perquè és molt descurat. Per què porta el seu <b>portallapis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"portallapis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> a la classe de llengües modernes?","t01-11-2":"El seu veí Edmon <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> no l’estima. És cert que és una mica peresós, però és callat i s’està quiet. No xerra; només que, en comptes d’atendre, s’estima més llegir els <b>contes</b> del seu <b>llibre de lectura</b>.","t01-11-3":"El tercer alumne d’aquest banc és <b>Lluís</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Lluís\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>. És aplicat. Escriu en un <b>full de paper</b> blanc. Davant seu ha deixat el seu <b>paper assecant</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"paper assecant\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>.","t01-12-1":"12. — Els alumnes del segon banc, a l’esquerra del professor, són molt joves. El primer, el petit <b>Emili</b>, encara no sap escriure gaire bé; porta el seu <b>pissarrí</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"pissarrí\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, el seu <b>llapis de pissarra</b> i la seva <b>esponja</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"esponja\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>.","t01-12-2":"Al seu costat hi ha <b>August</b> i <b>Bernat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>. Aquest darrer treballa bé, però el seu <b>aspecte</b> és molt descurat.","t01-13-1":"13. — Darrere d’ells hi ha tres <b>mandrosos</b>. <b>Albert</b> no s’aprèn les lliçons. <b>Jaume</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Jaume\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> dorm en comptes d’escoltar. La seva <b>peresa</b> li comporta <b>reprensions</b> i fins i tot <b>càstigs</b>. Finalment, <b>Cristià</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Cristià\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> és massa frívol. Es <b>porta</b> malament i no fa cap esforç per esmenar-se.","t01-14-1":"14. — Els seus veïns, en canvi, es porten bé. <b>Ernest</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernest\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> estima l’ordre i la regularitat; sempre fa servir el seu <b>regle</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"regle\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> i el seu <b>llapis</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"llapis\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>. És <b>extern</b>.","t01-14-2":"<b>Francesc</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Francesc\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> és <b>intern</b>; porta l’<b>uniforme</b> de l’institut; hi menja i hi dorm. És un bon <b>company</b>.","t01-14-3":"Maurici esmola el seu <b>llapis</b> amb la seva <b>navalla</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"navalla\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>; és molt curós.","t01-14-4":"Porta tots els seus llibres, la seva <b>gramàtica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"gramàtica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, el seu <b>quadern de notes</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"quadern de notes\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button> i fins i tot una <b>carpeta d’escriptori</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"carpeta d'escriptori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button>. La seva <b>cartera d’escola</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"cartera d'escola\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> és a terra darrere d’ell.","t01-14-5":"Les dues taules del fons de l’aula les ocupen <b>bons alumnes</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"bons alumnes\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">Dibuix i música.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — A l’<b>aula de dibuix</b> hi ha bonics <b>models</b> penjats de la paret i una <b>làmpada</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"làmpada\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> amb <b>pantalla</b>, penjada del sostre. El <b>professor</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"professor\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> és molt pacient; corregeix els <b>dibuixos</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"dibuixos\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> dels alumnes i els ensenya a dibuixar un <b>bust</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"bust\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> del natural.","t01-16-1":"16. — L’<b>aula de música</b> sembla molt interessant. Allà s’aprèn a llegir la <b>música</b>, a solfejar les <b>notes de l’escala</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"notes de l'escala\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> escrites al <b>pentagrama</b> (do, re, mi, fa, sol, la, si = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), a reconèixer les <b>claus</b> i a cantar boniques <b>melodies</b>. Les partitures es posen al <b>faristol</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"faristol\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button>. Un dels alumnes <b>toca el piano</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"toca el piano\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> i el <b>professor de música</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"professor de música\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>porta el compàs</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"porta el compàs\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — Comencem a veure un racó del <b>taller</b> de <b>treballs manuals</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"treballs manuals\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>, on els nois poden aprendre a raspallar la fusta i a llimar el ferro. No n’hi ha a tots els instituts.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">L’aula de ciències.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — El professor de matemàtiques ensenya als alumnes <b>geometria, aritmètica, càlcul</b> i el <b>sistema mètric</b>. Veiem a la taula les principals figures de geometria: un <b>cercle</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"cercle\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, un <b>quadrat</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"quadrat\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, un <b>triangle</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triangle\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, una <b>línia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"línia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"Veiem també una <b>operació</b>; no és una <b>suma</b>, ni una <b>resta</b>, ni una <b>multiplicació</b>: és una <b>divisió</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"divisió\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>.","t01-19-1":"19. — A la làmina del sistema mètric distingim: un <b>metre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"metre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, una <b>balança</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"balança\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> i les seves <b>peses</b>, un <b>litre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"litre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, un <b>decalitre</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"decalitre\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, un <b>decilitre</b> i un <b>metre cúbic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"metre cúbic\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"Els alumnes estudien també <b>ciències naturals</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"làmines murals\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button> — zoologia <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, botànica <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botànica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, geologia <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> — i <b>història</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"làmines murals\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>.","t01-19-3":"A l’armari hi ha els instruments de <b>física</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"física\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> i de <b>química</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"química\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button>.","t01-19-4":"Damunt de l’armari hi ha: una <b>esfera</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"esfera\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, un <b>con</b> i un <b>globus terraqüi</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"globus terraqüi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>.","t01-19-5":"Damunt de les làmines penja un <b>mapa</b> que representa les cinc parts del món: <b>Europa</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>Àsia</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Àsia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, <b>Àfrica</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Àfrica\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>Amèrica</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Amèrica\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Amèrica\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> i <b>Oceania</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Oceania\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, i els dos grans oceans, el <b>Pacífic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Pacífic\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> i l’<b>Atlàntic</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlàntic\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) Per als <i>noms de pila</i> s’aconsella transcriure’ls també en la seva forma llatina. És l’única manera d’evitar variants sense compte. D’altra banda, com triar entre <i>Giovanni, Jean,</i> <i>Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan,</i> etc.? Caldrà crear un diccionari especial de noms de pila? Prenguem del llatí el seu nominatiu i diguem: <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Gramàtica completa)."}}
